# tuning: macros/tuning_parameters_hkfd.mac
# Super-Kamiokande as WCSim builds it (WCSim/WCSim develop: /WCSim/WCgeom SuperK, its default PMT object), for
# photon-transport references: no QE, no collection efficiency, no dark noise. PMTs placed individually (no replicas:
# a GDML export of replicas is not read by lumen). Sources follow (run.sh).
/run/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/hits/verbose 0
/WCSim/WCgeom SuperK
/WCSim/PMT/ReplicaPlacement false
/WCSim/PMT/PositionVariation 0 mm
/WCSim/PMT/TankRadiusChange 0 0 0 mm
/WCSim/Construct
